{"seq":3,"slug":"metrics-and-alerting","title":"指标与告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/logging-and-observability/metrics-and-alerting","wordCount":702,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"指标与告警\">指标与告警</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>指标（Metrics）是对系统行为的数值化度量，告警（Alerting）是基于指标阈值或模式的自动通知机制。如果说日志告诉你&quot;发生了什么&quot;，追踪告诉你&quot;请求经过了哪里&quot;，那么指标告诉你&quot;系统整体状态如何&quot;。三者结合构成完整的可观测性体系。良好的指标和告警设计能让团队从&quot;被动救火&quot;转为&quot;主动发现&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"指标类型\">指标类型</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    M[&quot;指标类型&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;Counter 计数器&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; G[&quot;Gauge 仪表盘&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; H[&quot;Histogram 直方图&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; S[&quot;Summary 摘要&quot;]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;只增不减: 请求总数, 错误总数&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; G1[&quot;可增可减: 当前连接数, 队列深度&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; H1[&quot;分布统计: 响应时间分布&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; S1[&quot;客户端聚合: P50/P90/P99&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    M[\"指标类型\"] --&gt; C[\"Counter 计数器\"]\n    M --&gt; G[\"Gauge 仪表盘\"]\n    M --&gt; H[\"Histogram 直方图\"]\n    M --&gt; S[\"Summary 摘要\"]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[\"只增不减: 请求总数, 错误总数\"]\n    G --&gt; G1[\"可增可减: 当前连接数, 队列深度\"]\n    H --&gt; H1[\"分布统计: 响应时间分布\"]\n    S --&gt; S1[\"客户端聚合: P50/P90/P99\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>Prometheus 示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Counter</td>\n<td>单调递增</td>\n<td>请求数、错误数、处理字节</td>\n<td><code>http_requests_total</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gauge</td>\n<td>任意变化</td>\n<td>温度、队列长度、内存使用</td>\n<td><code>node_memory_available_bytes</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Histogram</td>\n<td>观测值分桶</td>\n<td>延迟分布、请求大小分布</td>\n<td><code>http_request_duration_seconds</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Summary</td>\n<td>客户端分位数</td>\n<td>P50/P95/P99 延迟</td>\n<td><code>rpc_duration_seconds</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"red-方法论\">RED 方法论</h3><p>面向请求的服务（API、微服务），使用 RED 方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# RED: Rate, Errors, Duration&#10;red_metrics = {&#10;    &quot;Rate&quot;: &quot;每秒请求数（QPS/RPS）&quot;,&#10;    &quot;Errors&quot;: &quot;每秒错误请求数或错误率&quot;,&#10;    &quot;Duration&quot;: &quot;请求延迟分布（P50/P95/P99）&quot;,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># RED: Rate, Errors, Duration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">red_metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"每秒请求数（QPS/RPS）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Errors\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"每秒错误请求数或错误率\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Duration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请求延迟分布（P50/P95/P99）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go + Prometheus: 实现 RED 指标&#10;import (&#10;    &quot;github.com/prometheus/client_golang/prometheus&quot;&#10;    &quot;github.com/prometheus/client_golang/prometheus/promauto&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;var (&#10;    // Rate: 请求总数（Counter）&#10;    httpRequestsTotal = promauto.NewCounterVec(&#10;        prometheus.CounterOpts{&#10;            Name: &quot;http_requests_total&quot;,&#10;            Help: &quot;Total HTTP requests&quot;,&#10;        },&#10;        []string{&quot;method&quot;, &quot;path&quot;, &quot;status&quot;},&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    // Errors: 从 httpRequestsTotal 中 status=5xx 过滤&#10;&#10;    // Duration: 请求延迟（Histogram）&#10;    httpRequestDuration = promauto.NewHistogramVec(&#10;        prometheus.HistogramOpts{&#10;            Name:    &quot;http_request_duration_seconds&quot;,&#10;            Help:    &quot;HTTP request duration in seconds&quot;,&#10;            Buckets: []float64{0.005, 0.01, 0.025, 0.05, 0.1, 0.25, 0.5, 1, 2.5, 5, 10},&#10;        },&#10;        []string{&quot;method&quot;, &quot;path&quot;},&#10;    )&#10;)&#10;&#10;func metricsMiddleware(next http.Handler) http.Handler {&#10;    return http.HandlerFunc(func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {&#10;        start := time.Now()&#10;        recorder := &amp;statusRecorder{ResponseWriter: w, status: 200}&#10;&#10;        next.ServeHTTP(recorder, r)&#10;&#10;        duration := time.Since(start).Seconds()&#10;        httpRequestsTotal.WithLabelValues(r.Method, r.URL.Path, strconv.Itoa(recorder.status)).Inc()&#10;        httpRequestDuration.WithLabelValues(r.Method, r.URL.Path).Observe(duration)&#10;    })&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go + Prometheus: 实现 RED 指标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><sp